WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.365
Nder worgo hirnaange Burkina Faso, nder lesdi Lobbi, duɗe mawnge ɗe kaaƴe ɗon dari caka leɗɗe, ɓadi gariiri Loropeni.

00:00:09.445 --> 00:00:15.824
Ɗu'um ɗon mawnina bee kaaƴe ɓerɗe, nden ɗon hawta nokkuure mawnde booɗnde jooni.

00:00:15.904 --> 00:00:17.842
Ɗuum woni laabi Loropeni.

00:00:17.922 --> 00:00:26.560
Ɗi'e ɓooyɗe ɓurɗe anndude: ɓe laati nokku arande Burkina Faso nder nder UNESCO List of World Heritage Sites.

00:00:26.640 --> 00:00:31.808
Ɗuum woni go'o nder cuuɗi kaaƴe ɓurɗi haɓɓugo nder nokkuure nden.

00:00:31.888 --> 00:00:34.391
Ammaa moye waɗi ɗe, e ngam ɗume?

00:00:34.471 --> 00:00:36.248
Ɗon woni fuɗɗam ɓernde.

00:00:36.328 --> 00:00:45.935
Goonga feere wi'i yimɓe Lobi, jooɗiiɓe nder nokkuure nde'e haa jooni, tawi ko'e maɓɓe ɗon dari nde kaakaaji maɓɓe ngari.

00:00:46.015 --> 00:00:52.797
Taariiha'en e archaeologists'en mbi'i feere-feere, ammaa ɓe meeɗaay faamugo koo ɗume.

00:00:52.877 --> 00:01:02.727
Goonga ɗon wi'a: nokkuure nde heewi ceede, nden ko'e ceede ɗe mbaawataa hawtaade bee ceede ceede nder nder Afrik hirnaange.

00:01:02.807 --> 00:01:07.005
Caggal ɗum, laamiiɓe ɓeen mbaawaa jaɓugo laamu laamu.

00:01:07.085 --> 00:01:14.029
Hakkilotooɓe ɗon njogii haala duuɓi nokkuure nden e anndal yimɓe maɓɓitiiɓe mayre nden.

00:01:14.109 --> 00:01:21.294
Bana nder nokkuuje mawɗe diga naane, haala yimɓe jooɗiiɓe ɓaawo cuuɗi ɗi'i e ko ɓe njogii.

00:01:21.374 --> 00:01:23.313
Kamɓe Loropeni ɗon suuɗa.

00:01:23.393 --> 00:01:32.758
Ammaa ɓe ɗon ƴamda boowo fuu bee ƴamɗe, ɓe ɗon wi'a ɓe taariika Afrik hirnaange ɓurii e ɓeydi ɓeydaaki no ɓe mbi'ata.
